        "TileImage": "$($repository b93da7de-2d20-4b2b-9764-567fa0e78a8d).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\ryou&apos;re targets are: Vince, Mason, Gray, Ellis and Ryan.\rAll 5 of them were friends with Niko Jovic, a world changing technician engineer who was inspired by Nikola Tesla.\r1 Night, Vince planed to kill Niko and sell his findings to the militia and the other 4 team-up with him.\rso they killed Niko and solled his work off and they now work for the militia.\rNiko&apos;s shareholders find out about this and they want us to get reoff these back stabbers.\rGood luck, 47",
